":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"tool_j6eFKS7LTlWd5eIwjxY9XTKr\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read image file [image/webp]\\n[Image: original 768x2569, displayed at 469x1568. Multiply coordinates by 1.64 to map to original image.]\"},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":\"\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\"}],\"details\":{\"fileSize\":225818,\"meta\":{\"source\":{\"type\":\"path\",\"value\":\"/tmp/mtx768_b.png\"}}},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1788079084242},{\"role\":\"toolResult\",\"toolCallId\":\"tool_zSwB0P58Qf364SxMaihcMTpc\",\"toolName\":\"read\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"text\",\"text\":\"Read image file [image/webp]\"},{\"type\":\"image\",\"data\":\"\",\"mimeType\":\"image/webp\"}],\"details\":{\"fileSize\":138094,\"meta\":{\"source\":{\"type\":\"path\",\"value\":\"/tmp/top_efficacy-safety-matrix-768.png\"}}},\"isError\":false,\"timestamp\":1788079084244},{\"role\":\"assistant\",\"content\":[{\"type\":\"thinking\",\"thinking\":\"Wait — now `top_efficacy-safety-matrix-768.png` (crop of efficacy-safety-matrix-768.png, y0–1200) shows 疗效与安全性矩阵 page correctly! But earlier the read of the FULL file showed 基线与人群总览... No wait, the earlier read of efficacy-safety-matrix-768.png I described \\\"基线与人群总览\\\" — but that may have been my misattribution from parallel call ordering. Actually in that parallel batch I read three images: matrix-768, baseline-768, disposition-768. The tool returned them in order: image1=matrix file (762px display), image2=baseline (311px), image3=disposition (210px). I described image1 as 基线， image2 as 试验完成情况， image3 as 矩阵. But the display heights: matrix file is 1580 tall → display nearly square (762x1568); baseline file 3869 → 311x1568; disposition 5738 → 210x1568. The descriptions I gave match these aspect ratios: image1 (near full height) showed 基线与人群总览？ Hmm I described image1 as \\\"基线与人群总览\\\"... but the crop now shows the matrix file IS 疗效与安全性矩阵 with bubble chart. And h_ header crops showed matrix file header = 